{"model":"qwen3.8-max","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## Examples\n\nEXAMPLE INPUT:\n    Frank is a 30-year-old developer with the Twitter handle @frankch. He plays drums.\n    \n    EXAMPLE OUTPUT:\n    ```json\n    {\"age\":30,\"name\":\"Frank\",\"username\":\"@frankch\",\"role\":\"user\",\"hobbies\":[\"playing drums\"]}\n    ```\n\n## Output Requirements\n\nRespond with a strict JSON object that follows the provided JSON Schema.\n\nSchema name: `User`\n\n{\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"x-title\": \"User\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"age\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\"\n        },\n        \"name\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"username\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"role\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"enum\": [\n                \"guest\",\n                \"user\",\n                \"admin\"\n            ],\n            \"x-php-class\": \"UserType\"\n        },\n        \"hobbies\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"description\": \"Correctly extract items of type: string\"\n            }\n        }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n        \"age\",\n        \"name\",\n        \"username\",\n        \"role\",\n        \"hobbies\"\n    ],\n    \"x-php-class\": \"User\",\n    \"additionalProperties\": false\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"Jason (@jxnlco) is 25 years old and is the admin of this project. He likes playing football and reading books."}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"response_format":{"type":"json_schema","json_schema":{"name":"User","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"age":{"type":"integer"},"name":{"type":"string"},"username":{"type":"string"},"role":{"type":"string","enum":["guest","user","admin"]},"hobbies":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","description":"Correctly extract items of type: string"}}},"required":["age","name","username","role","hobbies"],"additionalProperties":false},"strict":true}}}